  "review": "Distinct reviewer inspected native host owner paths and existing proof; no competing default native scheduler/lifecycle path found. Execution owner inspected renderer submissions, continuation callbacks and allocation ownership. No new runtime execution. Final artifact review verified81call references,40source hashes and10evidence hashes; corrected Main visual readback wording to distinguish bounded admission from unbounded completion wait.",
  "remaining": [
    "Specific END-03 negative demonstrating detection/rejection of a consumer on a competing private path is not established by existing coalescing/queue negatives.",
    "Auxiliary pending-queue-close evidence has zero own submissions; it does not prove callback-after-own-submit close or the prescribed strong-host-capture negative. Preserve that gap.",
